{"name":"Garnet Evening","hex":"#763b42","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"garnet","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A hard transparent mineral that is often used as gemstones and abrasives.","A dark red color, like that of the gemstone."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a dark red colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/garnet"},{"term":"evening","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The time of day between afternoon and night.","The time of the day between the approximate time of midwinter dusk and midnight (compare afternoon); the period after the end of regular office working hours."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of even"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/evening"}],"entries":[{"title":"Garnet","blocks":[{"text":"Garnets are a group of silicate minerals that have been used since the Bronze Age as gemstones and abrasives."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Garnet_Andradite20.jpg/330px-Garnet_Andradite20.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Garnet","wikidata":"Q105368"},{"title":"Evening","blocks":[{"text":"Evening is the period of a day that begins at the end of afternoon and overlaps with the beginning of night. It starts when the sun is close to the horizon and, according to most definitions, spans the period of night before bedtime or midnight. The exact times when evening begins and ends are subjective and depend on location and time of year. In some cases, evening is considered to begin during daylight; before sunset."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Evening_in_Parambikkulam%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg/330px-Evening_in_Parambikkulam%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evening","wikidata":"Q7725"},{"title":"Shades o